# Two-stage Miller OTA + nulling resistor (Stage-2 anchor): AutoCkt's two-stage with Rz in series with Cc.
PMOS M1a n4 n4 VDD VDD
PMOS M1b n5 n4 VDD VDD
NMOS M2a n4 VINN n3 VSS
NMOS M2b n5 VINP n3 VSS
NMOS M3 n3 IREF VSS VSS
NMOS M4 IREF IREF VSS VSS
PMOS M5 VOUT n5 VDD VDD
NMOS M6 VOUT IREF VSS VSS
C Cc n5 nz
R Rz nz VOUT
